# Unpublished Section

This directory is intentionally hidden from public navigation.

**Status:** Unpublished (development/private use)
**Access URL:** https://lotterlaw.com/spanish-tutor/
**Search Engines:** Blocked via robots.txt
**Sitemap:** Not included

## Purpose

Spanish language learning app with pickleball theme for personal/family use.

## Current Status (as of 2026-04-04)

- ✅ MVP app complete
- ✅ 3 of 10 lessons complete
- ⬜ Audio files not yet generated
- ⬜ Native speaker review pending
- ⬜ Testing with target user pending

## Deployment

This section deploys with the main LotterLaw website. It's accessible via direct URL but:
- Not linked from any navigation menus
- Not included in sitemap.xml
- Blocked from search engine indexing via robots.txt

## To Publish Later

If/when ready to make public:
1. Remove `/spanish-tutor/` from robots.txt
2. Add entry to sitemap.xml
3. Optionally add navigation link from main site
